    {
      "id": "1373665722538135744",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-18T14:17:09.728+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2025-05-18T14:17:35.372+00:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I don’t tend to have a present option for proposals I don’t launch a vote for ahead of time. Basically I see it as a more intimate response as likely the delegate’s already being questioned on not having voted yet, and abstention is more of a decision than an inaction at this point. Also unlike other similar systems I don’t need to advise the Delegate to vote their opinion vs. a decisive vote even when I’m 12 hours late to the stomp.\n\nBasically because FA optics. I won’t stop you from making the choice though - I’ll even count it",
      "author": {
